   Losey, Robert J.; Garvie-Lok, Sandra, Univ Alberta, Dept Anthropol, Edmonton, AB T6G 2H4, Canada.
   Bazaliiskii, Vladimir I., Irkutsk State Univ, Lab Archaeol \& Paleoecol, Irkutsk 664003, Russia.
   Germonpre, Mietje, Royal Belgian Inst Nat Sci, Dept Palaeontol, B-1000 Brussels, Belgium.
   Leonard, Jennifer A., CSIC, Estn Biol Donana, Seville 41092, Spain.
