Abstract = {The analysis of the aerial parts of Bonannia graeca led to the isolation
   and characterization of polar geranylated flavonoids (6 and 7). The
   structure elucidation was performed by extensive spectroscopic methods
   (1D and 20 NMR) and comparison with literature data. All natural
   flavonoids isolated from B. graeca (1-7) and some synthetic derivatives
   (8-11) were tested for cytotoxic activity against four human tumor cell
